  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "Hi @yeahdongcn, could you take a look at this one and start CI with `/tag-and-rerun-ci` when you have a chance? It rejects `--enable-lora` / `--lora-paths` on MLX at startup, since the stub never creates a LoRA manager and the first LoRA request crashes the scheduler. Unit test is in the PR. Thanks!\n\n麻烦帮忙 review 一下 🙏",
